        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ogre King</strong> is a 3D roguelike action RPG that blends fast-paced combat with emotional storytelling. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed primarily by a solo creator with the help of shared resources, collaborations, and AI tools, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the game focuses not on scale, but on delivering a compact and immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/543798f976eedbab6c05a7c65b0b4bb8.poster.avif?t=1765965510\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/543798f976eedbab6c05a7c65b0b4bb8.webm?t=1765965510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/543798f976eedbab6c05a7c65b0b4bb8.mp4?t=1765965510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, storybook-style cutscenes reveal fragments of Grom’s past and </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the hidden truth behind the fallen kingdom.     <br>In addition to combat, certain chapters also include a light puzzle–escape stage that offers </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a brief change of pace and challenges players in a different way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/94be00d77a6115680acd66306379d554.poster.avif?t=1765965510\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/94be00d77a6115680acd66306379d554.webm?t=1765965510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/94be00d77a6115680acd66306379d554.mp4?t=1765965510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter consists of three combat stages and one boss encounter, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >forming a short yet complete roguelike loop. Collect weapons and armor, craft potions, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and unlock abilities as you grow stronger through each challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/7b78d1ef290fb6f1598ac7fe3eb8b09b.poster.avif?t=1765965510\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/7b78d1ef290fb6f1598ac7fe3eb8b09b.webm?t=1765965510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/7b78d1ef290fb6f1598ac7fe3eb8b09b.mp4?t=1765965510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At certain points in the journey, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >players may encounter unexpected trials that reveal new aspects of the world and its mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after death, your experience and learned abilities persist — </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >every run brings you closer to mastery and understanding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though modest in scale, The Ogre King offers a focused, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >handcrafted adventure filled with emotion, challenge, and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/e9840956f0df259b9089674fbbc118c0.poster.avif?t=1765965510\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/e9840956f0df259b9089674fbbc118c0.webm?t=1765965510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/e9840956f0df259b9089674fbbc118c0.mp4?t=1765965510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ogre King</strong> is a 3D roguelike action RPG that blends fast-paced combat with emotional storytelling. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed primarily by a solo creator with the help of shared resources, collaborations, and AI tools, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the game focuses not on scale, but on delivering a compact and immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/543798f976eedbab6c05a7c65b0b4bb8.poster.avif?t=1765965510\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/543798f976eedbab6c05a7c65b0b4bb8.webm?t=1765965510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/543798f976eedbab6c05a7c65b0b4bb8.mp4?t=1765965510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, storybook-style cutscenes reveal fragments of Grom’s past and </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the hidden truth behind the fallen kingdom.     <br>In addition to combat, certain chapters also include a light puzzle–escape stage that offers </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a brief change of pace and challenges players in a different way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/94be00d77a6115680acd66306379d554.poster.avif?t=1765965510\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/94be00d77a6115680acd66306379d554.webm?t=1765965510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/94be00d77a6115680acd66306379d554.mp4?t=1765965510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter consists of three combat stages and one boss encounter, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >forming a short yet complete roguelike loop. Collect weapons and armor, craft potions, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and unlock abilities as you grow stronger through each challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/7b78d1ef290fb6f1598ac7fe3eb8b09b.poster.avif?t=1765965510\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/7b78d1ef290fb6f1598ac7fe3eb8b09b.webm?t=1765965510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/7b78d1ef290fb6f1598ac7fe3eb8b09b.mp4?t=1765965510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At certain points in the journey, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >players may encounter unexpected trials that reveal new aspects of the world and its mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after death, your experience and learned abilities persist — </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >every run brings you closer to mastery and understanding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though modest in scale, The Ogre King offers a focused, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >handcrafted adventure filled with emotion, challenge, and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/e9840956f0df259b9089674fbbc118c0.poster.avif?t=1765965510\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/e9840956f0df259b9089674fbbc118c0.webm?t=1765965510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153470/extras/e9840956f0df259b9089674fbbc118c0.mp4?t=1765965510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
